  "reviewer_note": "Shape tower. Height from a tourism body and a corporate page, shaft diameter only on one corporate page (We Build Value); no engineering or heritage page opened, so needs a better plan source. The OSM relation for Sky Tower measures about 40 m, which is the base building, so it was not used. The AA page says 328 m \"above sea level\"; Tourism Auckland and We Build Value say 328 m.",
